If you haven't got the passtune by your god you should answer improvise
with 'n' and enter the notes; according to the noise in the drawbridges
mechanics you may iterate according to the mastermind rules.

If you already got the passtune you should answer the question for your
passtune with 'y' and the drawbridge should come down.

You must be close enough to do so.  But not too close to be hit!

